cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "GNSS-R System Simulator"
abstract: >-
  Preliminary-design simulator for GNSS-Reflectometry (GNSS-R) LEO mission studies. It computes
  area coverage by specular reflections or near-backscatter swaths over a gridded region, and
  evaluates specular forward-scatter and bistatic backscatter events for a moving ocean target,
  including a bistatic link budget with ocean and ship scattering models.
